      },
      {
        "finding_number": 2,
        "line": 90,
        "marker": "## Finding 2: From state_1 to state_5 the aggregate peak shifts to shorter wavelength (negative/blue shift), peak intensity drops, and (where computable) the band broadens — across all series",
