      },
      {
        "finding_number": 4,
        "line": 227,
        "marker": "## Finding 4: Spectral-width (FWHM) and peak-position metrics are method- and band-sensitive; FWHM is undefined for 7 of 20 states and fails the 900–1250 nm band validation (applicability boundary)",
